OL,4,BNine wins in a row - Bournemouth &     
OL,5,BEvanilson continue to make history     
OL,6,G"We have to stick together and face    
OL,7,Greality."                              
OL,9,FThat is how Bournemouth manager Marco  
OL,10,FRose responded after his side had      
OL,11,Fdropped into the Premier League        
OL,12,Frelegation zone with a 5-1 defeat by   
OL,13,FChelsea.                               
OL,15,FSix weeks on, it is an entirely        
OL,16,Fdifferent story.                       
OL,18,FThe Cherries are up to fourth in the   
OL,19,Ftop flight, having clinched a club     
OL,20,Frecord ninth successive win in all     
OL,21,Fcompetitions - with five in the league.
